	(text "R · Regua R8 (8 teclas, ~15 x 160 mm, 2 camadas, 1,2 mm): 8 TMAG5253BA3 + 74HC595 (DHVQFN-16) + conector FFC de 8 vias, tudo no fundo." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 18 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid "74143c59-1a5a-545c-857c-b7232c14f967"))
	(text "FFC: 1 GND, 2 +3V3, 3 OUT, 4 DADO, 5 CLOCK, 6 LATCH, 7 GND, 8 GND. O 595 liga o EN de cada sensor (QA..QH); OE em GND, SRCLR em +3V3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 23 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid "2c9ec444-71d9-533e-b579-14c329f69226"))
